: Asesino de asesinos","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8upWJ1KTR1bAPqXCHAuVOhfuiAZ.jpg","synopsis":"Esta antología original de animación narra las aventuras de tres de los guerreros más fieros de la historia de la humanidad: una saqueadora vikinga que guía a su hijo en su sangrienta búsqueda de la venganza, un ninja del Japón feudal que se enfrenta a su hermano samurái en una brutal batalla por la sucesión y un piloto de la Segunda Guerra Mundial que surca los cielos para investigar una amenaza extraterrestre contra los Aliados.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Ciencia ficción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1376434","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:11:08.521Z"},{"id":"movie-1259983","slug":"movie-1259983","title":"Gourou","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ufdcPu8CdcsC0c73pATNjYXEmMR.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1259983","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:11:08.795Z"},{"id":"movie-1788779","slug":"movie-1788779","title":"Unang Pasok","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/daHU4hyjnp0vKO4Hs2n2Jiv8FXS.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1788779","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:11:09.072Z"},{"id":"movie-1514847","slug":"movie-1514847","title":"Iván & Hadoum","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9E0fCDOQxlo28jb0UZCxlilwfhk.jpg","synopsis":"Iván se enamora de Hadoum en el invernadero donde trabajan. Sin embargo, su anhelado ascenso laboral interfiere en la relación, obligándole a decidir qué tipo de hombre quiere ser.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://fly