ctos que los mordieron hace millones de años. Los paleontólogos Alan Grant, Ellie Sattler y Ian Malcolm visitan el parque y quedan muy sorprendidos con los resultados obtenidos. Pero cuando un problemático empleado manipula el sofisticado sistema de seguridad los dinosaurios escapan, obligando a los visitantes a luchar por su supervivencia.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/329","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1993,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:49.641Z"},{"id":"movie-1151265","slug":"movie-1151265","title":"La Fille dans les nuages","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o4V7Kq7KJhbjgPpzIYYBzfie77o.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Aventura","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1151265","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:49.919Z"},{"id":"movie-1526874","slug":"movie-1526874","title":"パリに咲くエトワール","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t340XkDSpjPJKk1xMvvpXH0rBKb.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1526874","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:50.201Z"},{"id":"movie-1319977","slug":"movie-1319977","title":"A la cara","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fzRQIB2FCCevWyBmcjwHVfvDPBl.jpg","synopsis":"Una famosa periodista acude a la casa de uno de sus haters para que le diga a la cara lo que escribió sobre ella en sus redes sociales. Pronto descubren que no son tan diferentes entre sí.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1319977","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:50.485Z"},{"id":"movie-1244531","slug":"movie-1244531","title":"Tiburón blanco: La bestia del mar","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/58xC3Vj5Td1UXhNaOQDOj2ygAH6.jpg","synopsis":"Un grupo de jóvenes soldados australianos naufraga en plena Segunda Guerra Mundial mientras cruza el mar de Timor. Atrapados en una balsa que se hace cada vez más pequeña, deberán sobrevivir a las aguas implacables, a sus propios conflictos, a los ataques enemigos y a la amenaza constante de un enorme y hambriento tiburón blanco.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Acción","Bélica","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1244531","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:50.762Z"},{"id":"movie-1596315","slug":"movie-1596315","title":"Ghost in the Machine","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ahuoVKlDHO61k7HbcbvUGsOPMiq.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1596315","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:51.037Z"},{"id":"movie-1471168","slug":"movie-1471168","title":"Barreda","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a25CyXmPJx6SrVFA9yirJTL9iAH.jpg","synopsis":"Película basada en uno de los crímenes más impactantes de la historia de Argentina. En 1992, Ricardo Barreda, un dentista de aspecto inofensivo, asesinó brutalmente a su mujer, a su suegra y a sus dos hijas adultas en el domicilio familiar. Presentándose a sí mismo como una víctima, Ricardo Barreda desató una tormenta mediática y avivó un escándalo nacional.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1471168","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:12:51.314Z"},{"id":"movie-1791574","slug":"movie-1791574","title":"My Hentai Girlfriend","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ufYZ46Lr5xzKxVUL4EJmkrQzGQO.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":