ria de Rapunzel, una joven con una larga cabellera dorada y mágica que ha vivido encerrada toda su vida en una torre oculta, bajo el estricto control de la manipuladora Madre Gothel, quien la mantiene aislada del mundo exterior para aprovechar los poderes rejuvenecedores de su pelo. Sin embargo, su monótona vida da un giro radical cuando el carismático y buscado bandido Flynn Rider tropieza con la torre mientras huye de la justicia, desatando una divertida, emocionante y mágica aventura mientras Rapunzel intenta descubrir la verdad sobre su pasado.","status":"In Production","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Familia","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1559978","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2028,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:14:24.537Z"},{"id":"movie-1470334","slug":"movie-1470334","title":"Allez Hëpp Hopp Hopp!","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHRBoPQbM5IenGheGEEtnN8NzgC.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Familia","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1470334","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:14:24.814Z"},{"id":"movie-1538273","slug":"movie-1538273","title":"Amor, amor, boda","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/43r7YZEpU24UCJH8TbHHecwH5MN.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando una novia se niega a abandonar el hogar familiar tras la boda, su marido debe averiguar si es capaz de adaptarse a la vida bajo el techo de sus suegros.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1538273","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:14:25.089Z"},{"id":"movie-1770183","slug":"movie-1770183","title":"Doctor Who: The Satan Pit","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zaR2tGiaDjbenNAWMYKo6E7zmRB.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia 