ara recuperar el Anillo, sería el final de la Tierra Media.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/120","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2001,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:19.782Z"},{"id":"movie-1415341","slug":"movie-1415341","title":"Auri","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dDt7E6pdoJAE6JvQtorCBvFhHtW.jpg","synopsis":"Auri es una ama de casa que se aventura a descubrir sus deseos y lograr independencia gracias a la llegada inesperada de su primer dinero «propio». Con su tarjeta de débito está decidida a conocer el mundo de los caprichos, mientras su marido vive obsesionado con convertir a su nieto en un futbolista millonario para eludir su realidad de hombre jubilado y la merma de sus facultades físicas.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1415341","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:20.053Z"},{"id":"movie-1004326","slug":"movie-1004326","title":"Electric Child","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yHORe7bkCURkPhewVH1cWXEGDV.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1004326","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:20.326Z"},{"id":"movie-1287520","slug":"movie-1287520","title":"November 1963","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ujp2aHu1lWMjAGoletnsmv3mcMn.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Historia","Crimen","Suspense","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1287520","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:20.603Z"},{"id":"movie-1418383","slug":"movie-1418383","title":"Good Sport","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1JEOuqm1IID2Yv6bEGJB0I8TySN.jpg","synop